{
    "test_name": "MOB.391_Work_Add_Failure",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.391_Work_Add_Failure",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.391` **Add a failure \u2014 proved after a reload \u2014 then delete it again.**\n- Four required lookups: asset, failure type, repair type, root cause type\n  (componentTypeId and discoveryCodeId are optional and skipped).\n- Key `BELT (R-L1) \u00b7 ADJUST \u00b7 TIME` \u2014 NOT the fixture's own\n  `MISSED` failure: the server keeps one per key and refused every repeat (bugs \u00a740).\n- \u2b50 Proof after a RELOAD: exactly one card with the key.\n- \ud83d\uded1 Self-cleaning with an **owner-sanctioned delete** (trap 2): `Delete Item` on that card\n  only \u2014 guarded in the same step as the gear click \u2014 then a reload proves it gone and the\n  original untouched.",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Work Order",
            "CRUD",
            "Failures",
            "self-cleaning"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
